    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the ice pack tip. i'll try that. my leg is actually starting to feel a bit warmer to the touch than the other one and there's a tiny bit of redness near the calf, but it's not really painful, just a dull ache. it feels like it's just very tense from the swelling. i'm pretty sure if i just stay off it and keep the ice on it, it'll settle down by tomorrow by itself, right? i really don't want to make a big deal out of nothing.",
